## MEETING OPPORTUNITY

The group moves toward the edge of an ancient crater.

Another rover is resting nearby.

Its panels are dusty.

Its body is covered in red soil.

Its camera head is turned toward the sky.

A soft chime sounds.

The rover awakens.

It is **Opportunity**, Spirit's twin sister.

Opportunity introduces herself.

She explains that she landed on Mars on January 25, 2004, in the Meridiani Planum region.

